                                                "sense_id": "26e4de4a-ac5c-3189-8707-c2065c09ae73",
                                                "text": "[T]his man is a servant of the eyes of men, and offers parchment or a white skin in sacrifice, but the flesh and the inwards he leaves to be consumed by a stranger fire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86728dbd-cb13-4130-983b-c11b18a0bfcb",
                                                "sense_id": "26e4de4a-ac5c-3189-8707-c2065c09ae73",
                                                "text": "Then sacrificing, laid the inwards and their fat."
